    "description": {
      "value": "You throw a magically propelled and chilled ball of dense snow. The target takes 2d4 cold damage and potentially other effects, depending on the result of your spell attack roll.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target takes double damage and a \u201310-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round.\n- **Success:** The target takes full damage and a \u20135-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** No effect."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 2d4."
